    <briefdescription>
<para>These routines set the axis specifications associated with the data domains. The domain is a derived type with private elements. These routines set the axis specifications associated with the data domains. The 2D version of these is a simple extension of 1D. <linebreak/>
Example usage: </para>    </briefdescription>
